    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University (AKU) Provost, Dr. Carl Amrhein and the Director, Networks of Quality, Teaching and Learning (QTL) Dr. Tashmin Khamis hereby congratulate Faculty as well as Teaching and Learning (TL_net) Staff who have recently gained their Fellowships from the Higher Education Academy (HEA) in the United Kingdom (UK).",
